    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“If reality has seams, you brought thread.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Patch-Logic Field (1/Soma Break).</strong> For 1 minute, allies within 2 squares reduce damage from hazards (fire, acid, falling debris, radiation bursts) by your tier (minimum 1).</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"circSalPatchLogic\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Patch-Logic Field</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Action &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">For 1 minute, allies within 2 squares reduce damage from hazards (fire, acid, falling debris, radiation) by your tier (min 1).</div>\n</div>",
